				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "{{gtClass:CarpDiagnosticHighlightStyler}} underlines whatever the compiler rejected, with the phase and message in a tooltip. Go ahead and hover over this one:"
