				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "{{gtClass:CarpDocumentationStyler}} puts a definition’s type and documentation one hover away, and {{gtClass:CarpLintHighlightStyler}} underlines whatever [angler](https://github.com/carpentry-org/angler), Carp’s linter, has to complain about."
			},
