				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "Completion isn’t a styler, but it works the same way: {{gtClass:CarpCompletionStrategy}} asks the server’s `complete` command for every visible name matching a prefix. That includes core and everything our earlier cells defined."
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
