					"uidString" : "YhahbPn9Sd+OxfkpjEVikg=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "All of these cache their answers by the text they styled, and the answers arrive asynchronously, so typing never waits for the compiler. While the cache is stale, they show nothing rather than something old. A missing underline is much less confusing than one in the wrong place, trust me."
			}
